 the national midterm environment likely to play an outsized role in the outcome.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6957, "margin": 2.83}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6748, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6753, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6783, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6236, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6194, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6727, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6943, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6373, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6827, "margin": 2.5}]}